# HERMES INTEGRATION POINT (Session 4): the signing key classes belong in .gitignore, not only in
# `.git/info/exclude` — that file is not cloned, so a fresh checkout had no protection at all
# until the guard happened to run. A `.p12`/`.pem`/`.key` next to the project would otherwise be
# one `git add -A` away from a public commit.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx

